{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-surjective}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9e1703c17930d2b7c92f9434fe021fc281f39f6622a6c3fb4a3dd1fb150a613b", "source_text": "Surjective morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1299eda6d79324aa50ace98fa9a3e4b9567487228f039142c1f5f4cc44c89e1d", "unit_id": "tag:04ZR:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$|f| : |\\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Y}|$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-properties-morphisms}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-surjective}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:da13097ad44608c5e6f7f71166df8602954b344e2f828b5d90374eb993fc3c8f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fcb5ceb24f618c613d4e09e54ad66283c7244731d163acd6a1c858ed4498b9c5", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks\nwhich is representable by algebraic spaces. In\nSection <REF_0001>\nwe have already defined what it means for <MATH_0002> to be surjective. In\nLemma <REF_0002>\nwe have seen that this is equivalent to requiring\n<MATH_0003> to be surjective.\nThis clears the way for the following definition.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b26c917426b91749126f0f6c1c8bc4b5801fd9b079a19e2d8f327cdf674fcb20", "unit_id": "tag:04ZR:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$|f| : |\\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Y}|$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-surjective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:da13097ad44608c5e6f7f71166df8602954b344e2f828b5d90374eb993fc3c8f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:eea851e1c65a314d61fae3a0e8d09d0f3310ef053ffc0a7782d7ce74aae15639", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nWe say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>surjective<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if the map\n<MATH_0003> of associated topological spaces\nis surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ff16b042de178b50a025018f2bf21bb9d94ac2b12effe7df9b08db8ae18f1909", "unit_id": "tag:04ZS:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:90358bab15e3996daaf5594ee70b40e1633e1aea96997b73ff932312be41fa11", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere are some lemmas.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:331aa3d3eeaec7d0a237d6168e4a3e9e2c4aa8224728f9fb300b31c12868c658", "unit_id": "tag:04ZR:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-surjective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fd59e38a85255596dc18a73d90e8e343d244804165ed27bb257be50c5dcb406e", "source_text": "The composition of surjective morphisms is surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4dd4fe35ca16f2c73e3e366b1f2912c07a5b5b2a6386e2f44bd252c2338c7567", "unit_id": "tag:04ZT:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:efa9ccb2f3babac512483c95d6f86dc73a9c9b386874d349cdbc7819ffebd894", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:04ZT:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-surjective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2cbbea678f50dadcd8e59a5de64bf1ed3bb2907b0effe0b75a009c98b6fb110d", "source_text": "The base change of a surjective morphism is surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0d5614dbadbf8741512daa6ee61694cffd32e3cab3ae71b919ab1c129a04b3fe", "unit_id": "tag:04ZU:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-points-cartesian}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c54c6d4c146c8c7e47114729c1008a888c7233e8c972bd98a391f5c2efd002ff", "source_text": "Omitted. Hint: Use\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:78fd6849490e48f8f7700d6240d4572ce6c05879cbe3365068145563ed4def6d", "unit_id": "tag:04ZU:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Y}' \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$f' : \\mathcal{Y}' \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}\n\\to \\mathcal{Y}'$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descent-surjective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9b76db864c02ae94ab11423ddbc030ed30fefb2ab2b4e4507510a6ce3f7fbcd8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6254e5955fc56dc64c256e84a1458e900bade6c7ff37f8c408926238ba1578ed", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a surjective morphism of algebraic\nstacks. If the base change <MATH_0003> of <MATH_0004> is surjective, then <MATH_0005> is surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:175c4df01de84b635a3f8227ec8f9eb69629ee593387f2fb95b678614ac31161", "unit_id": "tag:06PM:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-points-cartesian}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c54c6d4c146c8c7e47114729c1008a888c7233e8c972bd98a391f5c2efd002ff", "source_text": "Immediate from\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f2aada203cd8156b07e6df5c803c096c735ded6fb25d06497689eb1e124dfc3b", "unit_id": "tag:06PM:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-surjective-permanence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:39bd2493fd247e2a471c8c2c96f1b71de60de028dfdfeb5ac5cf742706ca362e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1485c065d0e67d81bcdaeb71ec560fe21201ba1f6ba56ce02db0622a96ec2777", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be morphisms of\nalgebraic stacks. If <MATH_0002> is surjective\nso is <MATH_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:695657fb27943606d06fd7a4ee023c9353d1e7f1a1654dd3a35f4846cbe5d116", "unit_id": "tag:06PN:statement"}
